            "review_title": "Review at Parosand Sky Bar Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Hieu Van\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n1\nGood food and service but…\nMar 2022\nOverall we were impressed with the restaurant and sky bar. The food was of good quality, comparable to some other popular Western cuisine restaurants in the Old Quarter. There were a variety of drinks and they were delicious too. However, we were generally disappointed with the music, as it was a little too loud and the playlist seems to have had only pop songs. There weren't any classical songs or house ones, which are what we expect on the sky bar. If you don't mind chilling in mediocre music then this place should probably be on your to-go list.\n\nOh, and we must also mention that the view here is spectacular. You'll love it.\nRead more\nWritten March 28, 2022",
